        "original_id": "1a168e07-eb1d-5337-9eb3-6d8eac7a26f7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pearl Jam\n- Products: \"You Are\", Riot Act\n- Companies: Epic Records\n- Events: September 11 attacks, 2000 Roskilde Festival crowd crush\n- Concepts: mortality, existentialism\n\nFacts:\n- Pearl Jam performed at the 2000 Roskilde Festival, where an accidental crowd crush caused the deaths of nine fans.\n- The September 11, 2001 terrorist attacks influenced the lyrical themes of Riot Act.\n- Pearl Jam released Riot Act, its seventh studio album, on November 12, 2002 through Epic Records.\n- Riot Act includes lyrics about mortality and existentialism.\n- Pearl Jam released the song \"You Are\" on its 2002 album Riot Act.",
